      "message": "Looking at this, does this have the potential to race if a writer ends up owning the lock? It seems like this could corrupt the sem-\u003eowner? Apologies if I\u0027m missing something.  I also wonder if the rwsem_set_reader_owned() is more appropriate to have in the vendorhook logic? Though I\u0027m not sure.",
